---
File: cmd/entire/cli/trail/store.go:221
Body: The FindByBranch comment claims it returns "nil, nil, nil" on not-found, but the function signature only returns (*Metadata, error). Update the comment to match the actual contract (nil, nil on not found).
```suggestion
// Returns (nil, nil) if no trail exists for the branch.
```

