File: cmd/entire/cli/trail/store.go:233
Body: FindByBranch calls List(), which flattens the entire trails tree and JSON-decodes every metadata.json, then scans to match branchName. This is potentially expensive on every checkpoint save (appendCheckpointToTrail) as trails grow. Consider implementing a streaming search that returns early, or introducing a branch->trail index to avoid decoding all trails each time.

