File: cmd/entire/cli/trail_cmd.go:637
Body: fetchTrailsBranch runs `git fetch` without disconnecting stdin. In hook/agent contexts this can hang waiting for credentials or prompts until the context timeout. Consider setting cmd.Stdin = nil (as done in push_common.go) and/or setting env like GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0 for best-effort non-interactive fetches.
```suggestion
	cmd := exec.CommandContext(ctx, "git", "fetch", "origin", refSpec)
	// Ensure non-interactive fetch in hook/agent contexts.
	cmd.Stdin = nil
	cmd.Env = append(os.Environ(), "GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0")
```

