File: cmd/entire/cli/trail_cmd.go:501
Body: AutoCreateTrail writes an operational message directly to os.Stderr on every auto-created trail. This can pollute agent/tool output streams and doesn't follow the documented logging split (logging package for operational events vs user-facing output). Consider using logging.Info/Warn (and avoid including user content) or making this entirely silent unless in verbose/debug mode.

